    "%@: %@." : {
      "comment" : "Warning after an import that left chapters out: how many chapters could not be read, a colon, then each chapter with its file and why, which are in English, separated by semicolons. %1$@ is the count sentence, such as \"2 of 14 chapters could not be read\", and %2$@ the chapters.",
