            "value" : "Chiede conferma, poi assegna alla libreria una nuova identità e la apre."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Asks first, then makes a new library index from the books in this folder and opens the library." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the button that opens the library without its index file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
