    "Book Info" : {
      "comment" : "Menu item of a book's row that opens the sheet with the book's information.\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Library group and read by VoiceOver. Opens the selected book's information, such as title and author. Also the title of the menu command of the same name.\nTitle of the reader toolbar's button that opens the book's information sheet.",
