      "comment" : "Button that closes a sheet, such as the filter presets sheet.\nButton that closes the Compare Libraries sheet.\nButton that finishes with a sheet or list and closes it, keeping what was done, such as the Bookmarks list over a book's reader, a feed's information, the OPML import, or the duplicate finder.\nText of the Folder Settings sheet, which shows one library folder's facts and its listening options. The title of the button that closes the sheet.\nTitle of the button that closes a sheet whose changes were already kept, such as Feed Info. Title case.\nTitle of the button that closes the Find Duplicate Books sheet.\nTitle of the toolbar button that leaves edit mode in the Library list, shown while edit mode is on.",
