    "Folder Settings" : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Folder Settings sheet, which shows one library folder's facts and its listening options. The sheet's navigation title (the window's title while it is open).\nTitle of the Library toolbar button, in a plain folder, that opens the folder's settings.",
