          }
        }
      }
    },
    "None" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Rewind on Resume unit picker: playback resumes where it stopped, with no rewinding.\nChoice in a Sound Effects pop-up button of Settings: no sound plays for the event.\nShown in place of a keyboard shortcut when an action has none.",
