    "OK" : {
      "comment" : "Button that closes a notice.\nButton that closes an alert and changes nothing.\nButton that closes an alert that only informs. Title case.\nButton that dismisses an alert about a problem.\nButton that dismisses an alert after reading it.\nButton that dismisses an alert, here the one that tells TextMouth quit to protect the Mac.\nButton that dismisses the reader's error alert.\nTitle of the button that dismisses the alert telling the result of importing or exporting pronunciation rules.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Of each feed's episodes and articles, lists only the one you opened last." : {
      "comment" : "Text of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. Its hint.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "De los episodios y artículos de cada canal, muestra solo el que abriste por última vez."
