    },
    "Play" : {
      "comment" : "Label of the button that starts playing the book.\nLabel of the reader's play and pause button while the book is not playing; it plays.\nName of the Play media event, a choice for one step of the media-key pattern that starts a sleep timer in Settings.\nName of the playback event whose sound is chosen in Settings, Sound Effects: playing starts.",
