    "Sleep Timer" : {
      "comment" : "Heading of the sleep timer group in the Playback settings.\nThe name of the sleep timer, wherever it is named: the title of its sheet over a book's reader (read by VoiceOver as its heading), the reader's Sleep Timer toolbar button, and the heading of its defaults in Settings.\nTitle of the reader toolbar's button that opens the sleep timer sheet.",
