          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Alcune modifiche non sono salvate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some changes to this book haven't been uploaded to %@ yet, so its download can't be removed." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why Remove Download was refused: some changes are not uploaded. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud service\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Algunos cambios de este libro aún no se han subido a %@, así que no se puede quitar su descarga."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Alcune modifiche a questo libro non sono ancora state caricate tramite %@, quindi il suo download non può essere rimosso."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some details appear once the book is downloaded." : {
      "comment" : "Note in Book Information when the book's file is only in the cloud, so the sheet shows the details the library keeps and the others wait for a download.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Algunos detalles aparecen cuando se descarga el libro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Alcuni dettagli compaiono quando il libro è scaricato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some files of “%@” are only in the cloud, and replacing it now would leave them behind. Download the book, then choose %@ again." : {
      "comment" : "Why Replace Existing waits: some files of the library's copy are only in the cloud. %1$@ is the book's title. %2$@ is the name of the Replace Existing button, which the sentence asks the user to choose again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Some files of “%1$@” are only in the cloud, and replacing it now would leave them behind. Download the book, then choose %2$@ again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Algunos archivos de “%1$@” están solo en la nube, y reemplazarlo ahora los dejaría atrás. Descarga el libro y vuelve a elegir %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Alcuni file di «%@» sono solo nel cloud e sostituirlo ora li lascerebbe indietro. Scarica il libro, poi scegli di nuovo %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Some of the library's files are in %@ and aren't on this Mac yet." : {
      "comment" : "Why the library can't be used yet: some of its files are only in the cloud. %@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Algunos archivos de la biblioteca están en %@ y aún no están en esta Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Alcuni file della libreria sono disponibili tramite %@ e non sono ancora su questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
