      "comment" : "Label of when the listener subscribed to the feed, in Feed Info.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. A condition's relation as its relation pop-up names it, by its test and whether it is negated. This is the form for the other case of the condition.",
