            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Avanzamento dell’estrazione del testo: %lld di %lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text could not be taken for a reason the system or another part of the app gives. %@ is the reason.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: %@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: %@ was removed, or its download deleted, so Edit Text has stopped for it." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an Edit Text session ends because the book left the library. %@ is the book's title. Edit Text is a menu command.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: %@ se quitó, o se eliminó su descarga, así que Editar texto se detuvo para él."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: %@ è stato rimosso, o il suo download eliminato, quindi Modifica testo si è interrotto per questo libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: chapter %@ of the edited text of %@ %@, which TextMouth can't read safely. Flatten it and save again, or undo the change; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text was refused because one chapter nests lists or quotes too deeply. %1$@ is the chapter's number, an identifier written without digit grouping; %2$@ is the book's title; %3$@ is a clause such as \"nests more than 20 levels deep\", written by another part of the app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Text not updated: chapter %1$@ of the edited text of %2$@ %3$@, which TextMouth can't read safely. Flatten it and save again, or undo the change; the book keeps its old text until then."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: el capítulo %1$@ del texto editado de %2$@ %3$@, algo que TextMouth no puede leer de forma segura. Simplifícalo y guarda de nuevo, o deshaz el cambio; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: il capitolo %@ del testo modificato di %@ %@, e TextMouth non può leggerlo in sicurezza. Appiattiscilo e salva di nuovo, oppure annulla la modifica; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the edited text of %@ %@, which TextMouth can't read safely. Flatten it and save again, or undo the change; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text was refused because it nests lists or quotes too deeply. %1$@ is the book's title; %2$@ is a clause such as \"nests more than 20 levels deep\", written by another part of the app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Text not updated: the edited text of %1$@ %2$@, which TextMouth can't read safely. Flatten it and save again, or undo the change; the book keeps its old text until then."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: el texto editado de %1$@ %2$@, algo que TextMouth no puede leer de forma segura. Simplifícalo y guarda de nuevo, o deshaz el cambio; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: il testo modificato di %@ %@, e TextMouth non può leggerlo in sicurezza. Appiattiscilo e salva di nuovo, oppure annulla la modifica; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the edited text of %@ has no chapter with any text. Undo the change and save again; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text was refused because no chapter has any text left. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: el texto editado de %@ no tiene ningún capítulo con texto. Deshaz el cambio y guarda de nuevo; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: il testo modificato di %@ non ha nessun capitolo con del testo. Annulla la modifica e salva di nuovo; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the edited text of %@ isn't UTF-8 text. Save it as UTF-8; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text was refused because it is not UTF-8 text. %@ is the book's title. UTF-8 is a text encoding.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: el texto editado de %@ no es texto UTF-8. Guárdalo como UTF-8; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: il testo modificato di %@ non è testo UTF-8. Salvalo come UTF-8; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the edited transcript of %@ adds words to a chapter with no speech, where they can't be kept. Remove them and save again; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited transcript was refused because the user added words to a chapter with no speech. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: la transcripción editada de %@ agrega palabras a un capítulo sin voz, donde no se pueden conservar. Quítalas y guarda de nuevo; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: la trascrizione modificata di %@ aggiunge parole a un capitolo senza parlato, dove non possono essere conservate. Rimuovile e salva di nuovo; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the edited transcript of %@ changes a chapter's heading, which comes from its audio. Put it back and save again; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited transcript was refused because the user changed a chapter's heading. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: la transcripción editada de %@ cambia el encabezado de un capítulo, que viene de su audio. Vuelve a ponerlo y guarda de nuevo; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: la trascrizione modificata di %@ cambia l’intestazione di un capitolo, che deriva dal suo audio. Rimettila com’era e salva di nuovo; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the edited transcript of %@ has %@, but the audiobook has %@. Keep every line beginning with <!-- chapter: and save again; the book keeps its old text until then." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited transcript was refused because its number of chapters no longer matches the audiobook's. %1$@ is the book's title; %2$@ and %3$@ are counts of chapters such as \"3 chapters\". \"<!-- chapter:\" is literal text in the file and stays exactly as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Text not updated: the edited transcript of %1$@ has %2$@, but the audiobook has %3$@. Keep every line beginning with <!-- chapter: and save again; the book keeps its old text until then."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: la transcripción editada de %1$@ tiene %2$@, pero el audiolibro tiene %3$@. Conserva cada línea que empieza con <!-- chapter: y guarda de nuevo; hasta entonces el libro conserva su texto anterior."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: la trascrizione modificata di %@ ha %@, ma l’audiolibro ne ha %@. Conserva ogni riga di capitolo che inizia con <!-- chapter: e salva di nuovo; fino ad allora il libro conserva il suo vecchio testo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the original file of %@ changed too. The book's text is read from it again the next time the book opens." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text was not taken because the book's own file changed too. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: el archivo original de %@ también cambió. El texto del libro se vuelve a leer de él la próxima vez que se abra el libro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: è cambiato anche il file originale di %@. Il testo del libro verrà letto di nuovo da esso alla prossima apertura del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text not updated: the transcript of %@ changed too. The book's text is written from it again the next time the book opens." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when an edited text was not taken because the book's transcript changed too. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Texto no actualizado: la transcripción de %@ también cambió. El texto del libro se vuelve a escribir a partir de ella la próxima vez que se abra el libro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Testo non aggiornato: è cambiata anche la trascrizione di %@. Il testo del libro verrà scritto di nuovo da essa alla prossima apertura del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text recognition could not read %@: %@." : {
      "comment" : "Warning after a book of pictures was imported: text recognition could not read some pages. %1$@ is how many of how many, such as \"1 of 12 pages\", and %2$@ names the pages and why, such as \"page 3 (its picture could not be decoded)\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
