            "value" : "TextMouth li sposta di nuovo quando ha finito di ricostruire la sua cartella dei dati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TextMouth moves them back once the move of its data directory ends." : {
      "comment" : "Why a failed move of files waits: it runs when the move of the data directory ends. \"Them\" is the files.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
