            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il libro"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book %@ is stored at %@, outside the data directory, so the move cannot carry it." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a move of the data directory was refused. %1$@ is the book's title; %2$@ is the path where its file is stored.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The book %1$@ is stored at %2$@, outside the data directory, so the move cannot carry it."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El libro %1$@ está guardado en %2$@, fuera del directorio de datos, así que el traslado no puede llevarlo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il libro %@ è archiviato in %@, fuori dalla cartella dei dati, quindi lo spostamento non può includerlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book can be transcribed again." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the question asked before an audiobook's transcript is deleted, after what stays.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Buch kann erneut transkribiert werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El libro se puede volver a transcribir."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il libro può essere trascritto di nuovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book has a transcript already, so TextMouth kept it." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that a transcript file was not attached because the book already had its own transcript.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Buch hat bereits ein Transkript, daher hat TextMouth es behalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El libro ya tiene una transcripción, así que TextMouth la conservó."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il libro ha già una trascrizione, quindi TextMouth l’ha mantenuta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book has no package to hold its text." : {
      "comment" : "Why an import failed: the book has no package folder to hold its text. Follows \"Import failed: \".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
