          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il testo del libro letto dalla sua voce in un unico file audio, con un capitolo per ogni intestazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's transcript couldn't be read, so it wasn't exported." : {
      "comment" : "Error in an export's summary: the audiobook's transcript could not be read, so no captions file was written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Transkript des Buchs konnte nicht gelesen werden, daher wurde es nicht exportiert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer la transcripción del libro, así que no se exportó."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile leggere la trascrizione del libro, quindi non è stata esportata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The book's voice can't be recorded to a file. Choose another voice with the %@ button in the reader, then export again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a spoken audio export was refused: the book's voice can't be recorded. %@ is the name of the Voice button in the book's reader.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voz del libro no se puede grabar en un archivo. Elige otra voz con el botón %@ del lector y vuelve a exportar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La voce del libro non può essere registrata in un file. Scegli un’altra voce con il pulsante %@ nel lettore, poi esporta di nuovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bookInfo.json file did not read back as it was written." : {
      "comment" : "Why an import failed: the book's record file, bookInfo.json, was written but did not read back as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo bookInfo.json no se leyó de vuelta tal como se escribió."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The books are in %@." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the announcement after an import at the Reading List added several books to it: the library folder they went to. %@ is the folder's path, such as Essays/Sea, or Library Root.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los libros están en %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "I libri sono in %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The braille code for reading and writing braille." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the braille code pop-up in the Braille tab of Settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El código braille para leer y escribir braille."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il codice braille per leggere e scrivere in braille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The braille code the book is written in." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the braille code pop-up in the Export dialog's braille options.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El código braille en el que está escrito el libro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il codice braille in cui è scritto il libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The braille is translated to print again with this code. Nothing checks that it is the right choice. If words read wrongly, choose another." : {
      "comment" : "Text of Speak Info, Book Information's braille code and text encoding rows, and the re-read alerts. What the alert says first: the braille is translated to print again with the code chosen, and nothing can tell whether it is the right one, since every braille text translates in every table, so a wrong one reads with no error.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El braille se vuelve a traducir a texto impreso con este código. Nada comprueba que sea la elección correcta. Si las palabras se leen mal, elige otro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il braille viene tradotto di nuovo in testo con questo codice. Nulla verifica che sia la scelta giusta. Se le parole vengono lette in modo errato, scegline un altro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The braille table writes an eight-dot cell, %@, but TextMouth's BRF and PEF files are six-dot only." : {
      "comment" : "Why braille could not be written to a BRF or PEF file: the braille table writes an eight-dot cell. %@ names the cell's dots, such as \"dots 4 and 7\". BRF and PEF are braille file formats.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla de braille escribe una celda de ocho puntos, %@, pero los archivos BRF y PEF de TextMouth son solo de seis puntos."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabella braille scrive una cella a otto punti, %@, ma i file BRF e PEF di TextMouth sono solo a sei punti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The braille table writes “%@” as an eight-dot cell, but TextMouth's BRF and PEF files are six-dot only." : {
      "comment" : "Why braille could not be written to a BRF or PEF file: the braille table writes a character with an eight-dot cell. %@ is the print character. BRF and PEF are braille file formats.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla de braille escribe «%@» como una celda de ocho puntos, pero los archivos BRF y PEF de TextMouth son solo de seis puntos."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabella braille scrive “%@” come cella a otto punti, ma i file BRF e PEF di TextMouth sono solo a sei punti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chosen table is built into TextMouth (liblouis %@)." : {
      "comment" : "Under the pop-ups in the Braille tab of Settings: the chosen braille table comes with TextMouth. %@ is the version of liblouis, the braille library, written as a version number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla elegida está integrada en TextMouth (liblouis %@)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabella scelta è integrata in TextMouth (liblouis %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chosen table is one of this Mac's VoiceOver braille tables (liblouis %@)." : {
      "comment" : "Under the pop-ups in the Braille tab of Settings: the chosen braille table is one of this Mac's. %@ is the version of liblouis, the braille library, written as a version number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla elegida es una de las tablas de braille de VoiceOver de esta Mac (liblouis %@)."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabella scelta è una delle tabelle braille di VoiceOver di questo Mac (liblouis %@)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The chosen table is one of this Mac's VoiceOver braille tables." : {
      "comment" : "Under the pop-ups in the Braille tab of Settings: the chosen braille table is one of this Mac's.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabla elegida es una de las tablas de braille de VoiceOver de esta Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La tabella scelta è una delle tabelle braille di VoiceOver di questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The clipboard has no text to paste, so the text is unchanged." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the announcement when Paste from Clipboard finds no text on the clipboard.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El portapapeles no tiene texto que pegar, así que el texto no cambió."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Negli appunti non c’è testo da incollare, quindi il testo non è cambiato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cloud service" : {
      "comment" : "How a sentence names the cloud service when it is unknown, at the start of the sentence, so it has a capital letter.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El servicio en la nube"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il servizio cloud"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy just imported is incomplete." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the last paragraph of the question asked about a duplicate book whose new copy is missing chapters. What it lacks follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia recién importada está incompleta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy made in the library did not match the original, so the copy was discarded." : {
      "comment" : "Why a book could not move into the current library format: the copy differed from the original.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia hecha en la biblioteca no coincidía con el original, así que se descartó."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia creata nella libreria non corrispondeva all’originale, quindi è stata scartata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The copy was already complete when Cancel was pressed, so the move went ahead." : {
      "comment" : "Sentence added to the done message of a move of the library when Cancel was pressed after the copy was complete.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia ya estaba completa cuando se pulsó Cancelar, así que el traslado siguió adelante."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia era già completa quando è stato premuto Annulla, quindi lo spostamento è proseguito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The correction file %@ is damaged or belongs to another recording, so %@ could not be converted." : {
      "comment" : "Why a hybrid WavPack file could not be converted at import: the correction file beside it (the same name ending in .wvc) is damaged or belongs to another recording. %1$@ is the correction file's name and %2$@ the WavPack file's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The correction file %1$@ is damaged or belongs to another recording, so %2$@ could not be converted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo de corrección %1$@ está dañado o pertenece a otra grabación, así que no se pudo convertir %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il file di correzione %@ è danneggiato o appartiene a un’altra registrazione, quindi non è stato possibile convertire %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cue sheet “%@” is too large to read." : {
      "comment" : "Refusal of a cue sheet that is larger than TextMouth reads. %@ is the cue sheet's file name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo CUE “%@” es demasiado grande para leerlo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cue sheet “%@” names none of the audio beside it, so its headings were not used." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that a cue sheet of an imported folder or archive was not used, because it names none of the audio beside it. %@ is the cue sheet's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo CUE “%@” no nombra ningún audio junto a él, así que no se usaron sus encabezados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current data directory does not exist." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the data directory was refused: the folder it would move from is missing.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El directorio de datos actual no existe."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cartella dei dati attuale non esiste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current directory will be retained as recovery data." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the question asked before moving the library: the old folder is kept.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El directorio actual se conservará como datos de recuperación."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cartella attuale verrà conservata come dati di ripristino."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cursor is %@." : {
      "comment" : "Announcement after Go to Page when the cursor is not on the page typed and there is no known reason. %@ says where the cursor is, such as \"on page 52\" or \"before page 1\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El cursor está %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il cursore è %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The data directory has no Logs folder, so logs go to %@ until it has one." : {
      "comment" : "The line under the Log location pop-up in the Storage settings while the data directory has no Logs folder. %@ is the folder's full path, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El directorio de datos no tiene carpeta Logs, así que los registros van a %@ hasta que la tenga."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cartella dei dati non ha una cartella Registri, quindi i registri vanno in %@ finché non ne avrà una."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The data directory is missing, so logs go to %@ until it is back." : {
      "comment" : "The line under the Log location pop-up in the Storage settings while the data directory is missing. %@ is the folder's full path, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Falta el directorio de datos, así que los registros van a %@ hasta que vuelva."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cartella dei dati manca, quindi i registri vanno in %@ finché non torna disponibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The data directory's Logs folder can't be written (%@), so logs go to %@ until it can." : {
      "comment" : "The line under the Log location pop-up in the Storage settings while the data directory's Logs folder cannot be written. %1$@ is the reason the system gives, which may be in English, and %2$@ is the folder's full path, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The data directory's Logs folder can't be written (%1$@), so logs go to %2$@ until it can."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede escribir en la carpeta Logs del directorio de datos (%1$@), así que los registros van a %2$@ hasta que se pueda."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non è possibile scrivere nella cartella Registri della cartella dei dati (%@), quindi i registri vanno in %@ finché non sarà possibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The destination folder %@ is no longer in the library." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when a move is refused because the folder it goes into is gone from the library. %@ is that folder's location, in straight double quotes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La carpeta de destino %@ ya no está en la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cartella di destinazione %@ non è più nella libreria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The details could not be copied" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement when Copy Details could not copy the report of a speech refusal to the pasteboard.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudieron copiar los detalles"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile copiare i dettagli"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk is almost full, so recording stopped. What was recorded is kept." : {
      "comment" : "Error in the Record window when the disk filled up while recording.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Speicherplatz ist fast voll, daher wurde die Aufnahme gestoppt. Das Aufgenommene bleibt erhalten."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El disco está casi lleno, así que la grabación se detuvo. Lo grabado se conserva."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il disco è quasi pieno, quindi la registrazione si è interrotta. Quanto registrato è stato conservato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk is too full to keep this audio for pasting." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the disk is too full to keep the audio cut or copied in the audio editor for Paste.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Speicherplatz reicht nicht, um dieses Audio zum Einsetzen aufzubewahren."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El disco está demasiado lleno para conservar este audio y pegarlo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il disco è troppo pieno per conservare questo audio per Incolla."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The disk lacks room: this needs about %@, and TextMouth keeps %@ free. Free some space, then export again." : {
      "comment" : "Why a spoken audio export was refused: the disk is too full. %1$@ is the space the export needs and %2$@ the space TextMouth always keeps free, each a size such as 1 GB.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The disk lacks room: this needs about %1$@, and TextMouth keeps %2$@ free. Free some space, then export again."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No hay espacio suficiente en el disco: esto necesita unos %1$@, y TextMouth mantiene libres %2$@. Libera espacio y vuelve a exportar."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Spazio insufficiente sul disco: servono circa %1$@ e TextMouth ne mantiene %2$@ liberi. Libera dello spazio, poi esporta di nuovo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download of %@ wasn't removed" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement that Remove Download did not remove one book's files. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se quitó la descarga de %@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Download di %@ non rimosso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download of “%@” will be deleted." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the confirmation that deletes one feed item's download. %@ is the episode's or article's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminará la descarga de “%@”."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il download di «%@» verrà eliminato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download was stopped." : {
      "comment" : "Why a feed item's download ended: it was stopped.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se detuvo la descarga."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The downloads of %@ weren't removed: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Announcement that Remove Download did not remove several books' files. %1$@ is a count of books, such as \"3 books\"; %2$@ is their titles as a list.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The downloads of %1$@ weren't removed: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se quitaron las descargas de %1$@: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Download di %@ non rimossi: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The drive “%@” isn't connected." : {
      "comment" : "Why the library can't be used: the drive that holds it is not connected. %@ is the drive's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La unidad «%@» no está conectada."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’unità “%@” non è collegata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edit history couldn't be read. A copy was kept in the book's package." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the book's saved edit history can't be read. A copy of the unreadable file was kept in the book's package.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Bearbeitungsverlauf konnte nicht gelesen werden. Eine Kopie wurde im Paket des Buchs aufbewahrt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer el historial de ediciones. Se conservó una copia en el paquete del libro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile leggere la cronologia delle modifiche. Una copia è stata conservata nel pacchetto del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edit history is only in the cloud, not on this Mac yet." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the audio editor can't open a book: its edit history is only in the cloud. A second sentence says to try again once the book has downloaded.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Bearbeitungsverlauf ist nur in der Cloud, noch nicht auf diesem Mac."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El historial de ediciones solo está en la nube, todavía no en esta Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cronologia delle modifiche è solo nel cloud, non ancora su questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edit history names a file outside the book, so it isn't used." : {
      "comment" : "Said when an audio edit can't proceed: the book's saved edit history points at a file outside the book's own package.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Bearbeitungsverlauf nennt eine Datei außerhalb des Buchs, daher wird er nicht verwendet."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El historial de ediciones nombra un archivo fuera del libro, así que no se usa."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cronologia delle modifiche indica un file fuori dal libro, quindi non viene usata."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edit history of %@ couldn't be read." : {
      "comment" : "Question asked when a book's saved audio edit history can't be read. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Bearbeitungsverlauf von %@ konnte nicht gelesen werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer el historial de ediciones de %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile leggere la cronologia delle modifiche di %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edited audio couldn't be written." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the edited audio could not be written, whatever the technical reason, which goes to the debug log.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das bearbeitete Audio konnte nicht geschrieben werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo escribir el audio editado."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile scrivere l’audio modificato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The edits couldn't be saved." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the audio editor's save fails. A sentence giving the reason follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bearbeitungen konnten nicht gesichert werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudieron guardar las ediciones."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile salvare le modifiche."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The episode leaves the list for good, and its download, if any, is deleted." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the confirmation before an episode is deleted from its feed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El episodio sale de la lista para siempre, y su descarga, si la tiene, se elimina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The episode leaves the list for good; the book it became in your library stays." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the confirmation before an episode that was moved into the library is deleted from its feed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El episodio sale de la lista para siempre; el libro en que se convirtió en tu biblioteca se queda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The existing copy's files are deleted permanently and cannot be recovered." : {
      "comment" : "Part of the question asked about a duplicate book: where the library's copy goes when replaced and files are deleted permanently.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los archivos de la copia existente se eliminan de forma permanente y no se pueden recuperar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The existing copy's files go to the Trash, but putting them back won't return that copy to your library." : {
      "comment" : "Part of the question asked about a duplicate book: where the library's copy goes when replaced and files go to the Trash.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
