          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’intestazione la cui sezione termina l’audio, con le sue sottointestazioni, oppure la fine del libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The headings from %@ run past the end of the audio, so the tracks were imported without them." : {
      "comment" : "Notice after an import of tracks that came without the headings of some cue sheets and label files, because a heading lay past the end of the audio. %@ is the files' names in curly quotes, listed as a sentence lists them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Los encabezados de %@ pasan del final del audio, así que las pistas se importaron sin ellos."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The import was stopped before its end." : {
      "comment" : "What the Import OPML sheet says once the listener stopped the import before its end.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La importación se detuvo antes de terminar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The index is not changed until you choose %@ or %@, which stay available from %@ at the top of the library." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of what Continue Reading does. %1$@ and %2$@ are the names of the Try Again and Rebuild Library Index buttons; %3$@ is the name of the Recovery Options button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The index is not changed until you choose %1$@ or %2$@, which stay available from %3$@ at the top of the library."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice no cambia hasta que elijas %1$@ o %2$@, que siguen disponibles en %3$@, en la parte superior de la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice non cambia finché non scegli %@ o %@, che restano disponibili da %@ nella parte superiore della libreria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The label file “%@” matches no audio file beside it by name, so its headings were not used." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that an Audacity label file of an imported folder or archive was not used, because no audio file beside it has its name. %@ is the label file's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo de etiquetas “%@” no coincide por nombre con ningún archivo de audio junto a él, así que no se usaron sus encabezados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The labels of the label file “%@” run past the end of its audio, so its headings were not used." : {
      "comment" : "Notice that an Audacity label file of an imported folder or archive was not used, because its labels lie past the end of its audio. %@ is the label file's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Las etiquetas del archivo de etiquetas “%@” pasan del final de su audio, así que no se usaron sus encabezados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language of the braille code for reading and writing braille." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the language pop-up in the Braille tab of Settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El idioma del código braille para leer y escribir braille."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La lingua del codice braille per leggere e scrivere in braille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language of the braille code the book is written in." : {
      "comment" : "The hint of the language pop-up in the Export dialog's braille options.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El idioma del código braille en el que está escrito el libro."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La lingua del codice braille in cui è scritto il libro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library already had different content under its package name, %@, so it was stored in a new package, %@, and its original file was kept at %@." : {
      "comment" : "Warning about a book that moved into the current library format. %1$@ is the name of the package that already held other content; %2$@ is the name of the new package; %3$@ is the path where the original file was kept.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The library already had different content under its package name, %1$@, so it was stored in a new package, %2$@, and its original file was kept at %3$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca ya tenía contenido distinto con el nombre de paquete %1$@, así que se guardó en un paquete nuevo, %2$@, y su archivo original se conservó en %3$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria aveva già un contenuto diverso con il nome del suo pacchetto, %@, quindi è stato archiviato in un nuovo pacchetto, %@, e il suo file originale è stato conservato in %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library at %@ isn't available." : {
      "comment" : "Error text when the library's folder can't be used. It follows what failed, as in \"Listening statistics could not be saved: The library at /Volumes/Backup/TextMouth isn't available.\" %@ is the folder's path.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca de %@ no está disponible."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria in %@ non è disponibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't be reached, so TextMouth can't keep the new copy of “%@”. Answer again once it is back." : {
      "comment" : "What the duplicate question says when Keep Both or Replace Existing is chosen while the library cannot be reached. %@ is the new copy's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede acceder a la biblioteca, así que TextMouth no puede conservar la copia nueva de “%@”. Responde de nuevo cuando vuelva."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move books now. Try again once it is available." : {
      "comment" : "Why Move to Library did nothing: the library's index is being recovered or the data directory is away or moving. Follows \"Could not move to the library: \".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no puede mover libros ahora. Inténtalo de nuevo cuando esté disponible."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move while a book is open. Close %@ first." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the library was refused: a book is open in a reader. %@ is the book's title, in quotation marks.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no se puede mover mientras hay un libro abierto. Cierra primero %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non può essere spostata mentre un libro è aperto. Chiudi prima %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move while a book is open. Close it first." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the library was refused: a book is open in a reader. \"It\" is that book.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no se puede mover mientras hay un libro abierto. Ciérralo primero."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non può essere spostata mentre un libro è aperto. Chiudilo prima."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library can't move while books are open." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a move of the library was refused: several books are open in readers.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no se puede mover mientras hay libros abiertos."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non può essere spostata mentre dei libri sono aperti."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library folder the recording is saved in." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint of the Save in pop-up of the Record window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Der Bibliotheksordner, in dem die Aufnahme gesichert wird."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La carpeta de la biblioteca donde se guarda la grabación."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La cartella della libreria in cui viene salvata la registrazione."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index can't be read. Choose Try Again or Rebuild Library Index in the Library window first." : {
      "comment" : "Why a command that acts on the library index was refused: the index can't be read yet. Try Again and Rebuild Library Index are button names in the Library window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede leer el índice de la biblioteca. Primero elige Reintentar o Reconstruir índice de la biblioteca en la ventana de la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile leggere l’indice della libreria. Scegli prima Riprova o Ricostruisci l’indice della libreria nella finestra della libreria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index could not be read, so library changes are not being saved." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the Storage settings explanation while the library index can't be read.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer el índice de la biblioteca, así que los cambios de la biblioteca no se están guardando."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non è stato possibile leggere l’indice della libreria, quindi le modifiche alla libreria non vengono salvate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index could not be read." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the banner shown at the top of the library while the library index is unreadable.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo leer el índice de la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non è stato possibile leggere l’indice della libreria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index is already readable." : {
      "comment" : "Outcome of a library index recovery command when no recovery was in progress.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice de la biblioteca ya se puede leer."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice della libreria è già leggibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index still could not be read." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the outcome of Try Again on the library index recovery sheet when the index is still unreadable. The reason follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice de la biblioteca sigue sin poder leerse."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice della libreria non è ancora leggibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index was not rebuilt." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of the outcome of Rebuild Library Index when it replaced nothing. The reason follows.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se reconstruyó el índice de la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice della libreria non è stato ricostruito."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index was read successfully. Your library has %@, and changes are being saved again." : {
      "comment" : "Outcome of Try Again on the library index recovery sheet: the index could be read. %@ is a count of books, such as \"743 books\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice de la biblioteca se leyó correctamente. Tu biblioteca tiene %@, y los cambios se están guardando de nuevo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice della libreria è stato letto correttamente. La tua libreria contiene %@ e le modifiche vengono di nuovo salvate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library index was rebuilt with %@." : {
      "comment" : "Outcome of Rebuild Library Index. %@ is a count of books, such as \"743 books\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice de la biblioteca se reconstruyó con %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice della libreria è stato ricostruito con %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library is available." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when the library, which had been missing, is found again.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca está disponible."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria è disponibile."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library is still at %@." : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the message after the move of the library was cancelled. %@ is the library's path, with where it leads when it is a link.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca sigue en %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria si trova ancora in %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library is still not available. %@" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement when Try Again on the Library Not Available screen finds the library still missing. %@ is the sentence that says why it is not available.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca sigue sin estar disponible. %@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non è ancora disponibile. %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library isn't available, so logs go to %@ until it is." : {
      "comment" : "The line under the Log location pop-up in the Storage settings while the library cannot be reached. %@ is the folder's full path, which stays as written.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no está disponible, así que los registros van a %@ hasta que lo esté."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non è disponibile, quindi i registri vanno in %@ finché non lo sarà."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library isn't available, so the filter presets can't be saved." : {
      "comment" : "Said when the filter presets can't be saved because the library's data folder can't be used.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek ist nicht verfügbar, daher können die Filtervoreinstellungen nicht gesichert werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no está disponible, así que no se pueden guardar los preajustes de filtros."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non è disponibile, quindi i preset dei filtri non possono essere salvati."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library isn't available, so the rules can't be opened now." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when Edit Rules is pressed while the library's data folder cannot be used.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Die Bibliothek ist nicht verfügbar, daher können die Regeln jetzt nicht geöffnet werden."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no está disponible, así que ahora no se pueden abrir las reglas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non è disponibile, quindi ora non si possono aprire le regole."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library isn't in a cloud folder, so its books are always on this Mac." : {
      "comment" : "Why Keep on This Mac or Stop Keeping on This Mac changed nothing: the library is not in a cloud folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca no está en una carpeta de la nube, así que sus libros siempre están en esta Mac."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria non è in una cartella cloud, quindi i suoi libri sono sempre su questo Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library now shows a temporary list rebuilt from the books on disk." : {
      "comment" : "Second sentence of the library index recovery sheet.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La biblioteca ahora muestra una lista temporal reconstruida a partir de los libros del disco."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La libreria mostra ora un elenco temporaneo ricostruito dai libri sul disco."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library's identity file is on this Mac, but its index, %@, hasn't arrived from %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why the library can't open: its index file did not arrive from the cloud service. %1$@ is the index's file name, which stays as written; %2$@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The library's identity file is on this Mac, but its index, %1$@, hasn't arrived from %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El archivo de identidad de la biblioteca está en esta Mac, pero su índice, %1$@, no ha llegado desde %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il file di identità della libreria è su questo Mac, ma il suo indice, %@, non è arrivato tramite %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library's index is on this Mac, but its identity file, %@, hasn't arrived from %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why the library can't open: its identity file did not arrive from the cloud service. %1$@ is the identity file's name, which stays as written; %2$@ is the cloud service's name, or \"the cloud\" when it is unknown.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The library's index is on this Mac, but its identity file, %1$@, hasn't arrived from %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El índice de la biblioteca está en esta Mac, pero su archivo de identidad, %1$@, no ha llegado desde %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "L’indice della libreria è su questo Mac, ma il suo file di identità, %@, non è arrivato tramite %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list follows a change of %@ at once; what downloads or goes waits until the change has stayed for ten seconds, and VoiceOver announces it then." : {
      "comment" : "The note under the List and download controls: when a change takes effect. %@ is the name of the List and download choice.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La lista sigue de inmediato un cambio de %@; lo que se descarga o se elimina espera a que el cambio lleve diez segundos, y VoiceOver lo anuncia entonces."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The manifest of %@ can't be edited: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Message when a book's manifest could not be readied for editing. %1$@ is the book's title; %2$@ is the reason, a sentence from the system or TextMouth.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The manifest of %1$@ can't be edited: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se puede editar el manifiesto de %1$@: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Impossibile modificare il manifest di %@: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone Punch In records from. TextMouth remembers it, apart from macOS's input." : {
      "comment" : "Hint of the audio editor's microphone pop-up. \"Record window\" is TextMouth's window that records audio.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Mikrofon, von dem „Darüber aufnehmen“ aufnimmt. TextMouth merkt es sich, unabhängig vom Eingang von macOS."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El micrófono que usa Grabar encima para grabar. TextMouth lo recuerda, aparte de la entrada de macOS."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il microfono da cui registra Registra sopra. TextMouth lo ricorda, a prescindere dall’ingresso di macOS."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone TextMouth used last isn't connected, so recordings use %@." : {
      "comment" : "Said by the Record window when the microphone used last is not connected as the window opens. %@ is the name of the microphone recordings use instead.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das zuletzt von TextMouth verwendete Mikrofon ist nicht verbunden, daher verwenden Aufnahmen %@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El micrófono que TextMouth usó por última vez no está conectado, así que las grabaciones usan %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il microfono usato per ultimo da TextMouth non è collegato, quindi le registrazioni usano %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The microphone to record from. TextMouth remembers it; the input macOS uses elsewhere is unchanged." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver hint and tooltip of the Microphone pop-up in the Record window. TextMouth is the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Das Mikrofon, von dem aufgenommen wird. TextMouth merkt es sich; der Eingang, den macOS sonst verwendet, bleibt unverändert."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El micrófono con el que se graba. TextMouth lo recuerda; la entrada que macOS usa en otros lugares no cambia."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il microfono da cui registrare. TextMouth lo ricorda; l’ingresso che macOS usa altrove non cambia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The migrated copy is missing the content for %@." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the data directory failed: the copy lacks a book's content. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "A la copia migrada le falta el contenido de %@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Nella copia migrata manca il contenuto di %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The migrated library index could not be validated." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the data directory failed: the copied library index did not pass its check.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "No se pudo validar el índice migrado de la biblioteca."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Non è stato possibile convalidare l’indice della libreria migrato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most time the whole sequence may take. Shorter windows mean fewer accidental matches but quicker presses." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under the restart gesture's time window slider in the Miscellaneous settings.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo máximo que puede durar toda la secuencia. Ventanas más cortas significan menos coincidencias accidentales pero pulsaciones más rápidas."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Il tempo massimo che l’intera sequenza può richiedere. Intervalli più brevi significano meno corrispondenze accidentali ma pressioni più rapide."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The move was cancelled, so nothing changed." : {
      "comment" : "Why a move of the data directory ended: the listener cancelled it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Se canceló el traslado, así que no cambió nada."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "Lo spostamento è stato annullato, quindi nulla è cambiato."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new copy replaced “%@”, but the old copy's files could not be deleted and stay in its folder: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Alert after Replace Existing when the old copy's files could not be deleted. %1$@ is the book's title. %2$@ is why they could not be deleted.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The new copy replaced “%1$@”, but the old copy's files could not be deleted and stay in its folder: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia nueva reemplazó “%1$@”, pero los archivos de la copia anterior no se pudieron eliminar y permanecen en su carpeta: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La nuova copia ha sostituito «%@», ma i file della vecchia copia non sono stati eliminati e restano nella sua cartella: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new copy replaced “%@”, but the old copy's files could not be moved to the Trash and stay in its folder: %@" : {
      "comment" : "Alert after Replace Existing when the old copy's files could not be moved to the Trash. %1$@ is the book's title. %2$@ is why they could not be moved.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The new copy replaced “%1$@”, but the old copy's files could not be moved to the Trash and stay in its folder: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La copia nueva reemplazó “%1$@”, pero los archivos de la copia anterior no se pudieron mover a la Papelera y permanecen en su carpeta: %2$@"
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La nuova copia ha sostituito «%@», ma i file della vecchia copia non sono stati spostati nel Cestino e restano nella sua cartella: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new location, %@, contains the current data directory, %@." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a move of the data directory was refused. %1$@ is the new location's path; %2$@ is the current data directory, with the link that leads to it when there is one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "The new location, %1$@, contains the current data directory, %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La ubicación nueva, %1$@, contiene el directorio de datos actual, %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La nuova posizione, %@, contiene la cartella dei dati attuale, %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new location, %@, is a file, not a folder." : {
      "comment" : "First sentence of why a move of the data directory was refused. %@ is the new location's path, with where it leads when it is a link.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "La ubicación nueva, %@, es un archivo, no una carpeta."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
