          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” non è un file XML completo e valido."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is now read as %@." : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver announcement once a book was read again. %1$@ is the book's title and %2$@ describes how it is read now, such as \"Windows-1251 (Cyrillic), chosen\".",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "“%1$@” is now read as %2$@."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” ahora se lee como %2$@."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "«%@» ora viene letto come %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is only in the cloud. Download the book, then transcribe it." : {
      "comment" : "Error shown when an audio file has not been downloaded from the cloud drive. %@ is the audio file's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ ist nur in der Cloud. Lade das Buch herunter und transkribiere es dann."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” solo está en la nube. Descarga el libro y luego transcríbelo."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” è solo nel cloud. Scarica il libro, poi trascrivilo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is recording. Stop or discard it with Clear Selection, then quit." : {
      "comment" : "Said in an audio editor when TextMouth can't quit because a punch-in records there. %@ is the book's title. \"Clear Selection\" is the name of a command.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ nimmt auf. Stoppe oder verwirf die Aufnahme mit „Auswahl aufheben“ und beende dann TextMouth."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” está grabando. Detén la grabación o descártala con Quitar selección y luego sal de TextMouth."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "In “%@” è in corso una registrazione. Interrompila o scartala con Deseleziona, poi esci."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is still working. Quit once the change is done." : {
      "comment" : "Said in an audio editor when TextMouth can't quit because its work is under way. %@ is the book's title.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "„%@“ arbeitet noch. Beende TextMouth, sobald die Änderung abgeschlossen ist."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” sigue trabajando. Cierra TextMouth cuando termine el cambio."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "“%@” sta ancora elaborando. Esci quando la modifica è finita."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "“%@” is too large to read." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the alert when a pronunciation lexicon file is too large. %@ is the file's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "machine_translated",
            "value" : "«%@» es demasiado grande para leerlo."
          }
